# Step 1: Interaction Terms (Cross Features)
# Feature name: loc_x_vg
# Feature description: This feature is the product of loc (lines of code) and v(g) (cyclomatic complexity). It captures the relationship between code size and complexity, which can be a strong determinant of potential defects.
# Usefulness: Large functions with high complexity may be more prone to defects. Combining these two features helps model this interaction.

df['loc_x_vg'] = df['loc'] * df['v(g)']
