# Feature description: Ratio of comment_to_code_ratio normalized by the loc feature.
# Usefulness: The comment_to_code_ratio can vary significantly depending on the size of the code module. Normalizing it by the lines of code (loc) provides a better context of how heavily commented the module is relative to its size, potentially reducing noise.

